(1. Describe the process of registering for an NPTEL online certification course.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
70.8661417322834666 261.8466929133859367 Td
(First, the learner visits the official NPTEL website www.nptel.ac.in Next, the learner browses the) Tj
T* (list of available courses by discipline or by institute. Then, the learner reads the course description,) Tj
T* (syllabus and duration to check whether the course suits his or her needs. After choosing a course,) Tj
T* (the learner clicks the 'Enroll' button. Then, the learner logs in with an email ID or a Google) Tj
T* (account, or creates a new account if necessary. After that, the learner fills in the personal and) Tj
T* (college details in the registration form. Once the details are saved, the learner is enrolled and gets) Tj
T* (access to the weekly lectures and assignments. Later, the learner opens the certification exam) Tj
T* (registration page and selects the preferred exam city. Then, the learner pays the exam fee online) Tj
T* (through net banking, card or UPI. Finally, the learner receives a confirmation email containing the) Tj
T* (exam details.) Tj
ET
